 "question": "How exposed is Southwest to Boeing delivery delays?",
 "route": "answer",
 "answer": [
  {
   "text": "Southwest is highly dependent on Boeing as its sole aircraft manufacturer, and prolonged delivery delays for MAX aircraft could materially and adversely affect the company's business plans, strategies, and results of operations.",
   "citations": [
    "0000092380-26-000004#1A-61"
   ],
   "metrics": [],
   "signals": []
  },
  {
   "text": "The company has repeatedly adjusted its capacity and delivery expectations due to Boeing's delays, noting that its contractual order book does not reflect these ongoing production issues.",
   "citations": [
    "0000092380-26-000004#7-90",
    "0000092380-26-000077#2-342"
   ],
   "metrics": [],
   "signals": []
  },
  {
   "text": "As of early 2026, the company reported that it had not received 54 MAX -8 aircraft that were contractually committed for 2025.",
   "citations": [
    "0000092380-26-000004#7-90"
   ],
   "metrics": [],
   "signals": []
  }
 ],
